      "content": "but it doesn't feel like \"courage\" or \"new purpose.\" it just feels like nothing. it's heavy. like, if there's no truth and no meaning, why does any of this matter? why am i even still here going through the motions every day? it just seems so exhausting to keep fighting for something that isn't even real.",
